    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "19. FINISHED BOARD SHALL BE FREE OF ALL RESIDUES." (at 183.241336 166.491616) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 37a0946d-8876-42c6-8559-cef1b14776e5)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "There shall be no ink on any exposed land." (at 175.579004 62.366749) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 574d7fa7-3e99-40a1-bbd0-e277e492c614)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "12.  PCB must be tested per IPC-9252 Class 2.  Any deviation from this" (at 196.195338 111.950019) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 5c915016-08a7-4cf8-9845-337684f56f19)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "(No hatching, grids, or lines allowed.)" (at 171.811337 97.075038) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 5f8c2cd1-d793-4a10-918f-de3edee53726)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "0.021 to 0.090 inches - +/-0.003" (at 170.287333 131.783327) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 689ce937-d642-43ec-ac40-e4b91bfdc7f4)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "B.  The thieving pattern is made up of individual and separate pads." (at 193.020342 92.116711) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 6efa1e5d-6776-4595-9023-a29ea8255c18)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "requirement must have written authorization from Christopher Buckley" (at 193.570674 116.908346) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 747d199b-64d7-42f1-a1ca-11a4121bce3d)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "Under 0.021 inches - +0.003/-0.006" (at 172.15 126.825) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 772e954d-ff8d-4ff3-bf70-0715b56a5ce6)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "1. ALL COMPONENTS SHALL BE RoHS COMPLIANT." (at 178.838669 24.79588) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 7edf8e40-1e9e-477e-a159-be61a6e5051b)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "14.  Traces shall finish at the artwork width, +/- 1 mil." (at 185.061671 141.699981) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 83906ee9-7b8d-46df-97c4-d2f080f0696b)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "There shall be no soldermask on any land." (at 175.113337 42.533441) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 94ac96ff-9abc-4537-911c-89f666e6773b)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "A.  All thieving pads are kept at least 55 mils from other features," (at 191.962005 87.158384) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 990f2399-58e7-46fc-b2b8-062a2c1e966c)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "Soldermask shall be in accordance with IPC-SM-840 Class T." (at 188.575336 37.575114) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 9bb09d7e-6d34-4fa7-8454-5829e8d6c59f)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "3.  Silkscreen:  DO NOT clear silkscreen (legend) from tented vias." (at 191.835004 47.491768) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp a1350469-9b3e-4417-b117-b78a3686e3ad)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "15.  Final PCB thickness 1.0mm" (at 167.789668 146.658308) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp a7612a2f-e219-4a68-82cd-f464997752b9)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "10.  Ref.: Minimum Conductor Width/Spacing:  0.1mm/0.1mm." (at 188.575339 102.033365) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp b90f5e1b-e143-49fd-a32b-f7aeba1fc1b8)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "17. ALL UNUSED THROUGH HOLE COMPONENT LOCATIONS SHALL BE FREE OF SOLDER." (at 203.561339 156.574962) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp bc0d0119-65aa-40bc-b3d8-645195838f8a)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "5.  Minimum copper plate in all holes to be 0.001 inches." (at 185.950671 72.283403) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp c41697e2-d12c-46cd-90dc-bb244edb9a49)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "2.  Soldermask:  Soldermask over bare copper, both sides.\nColor: Green" (at 145.808084 31.185497) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp c7136b0e-714f-409e-9caa-abf8630d923c)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)) (justify left))
  )
  (gr_text "16.  Surface finish: ENIG" (at 162.667336 151.616635) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp daf193a9-e64b-4bfd-b84c-dcc0dafe41d6)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "Over 0.090 inches - +/-0.006" (at 167.408667 136.741654) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp e65e1a72-e35b-430f-a4c8-956d1ab4057d)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "6.  Copper thieving may be added by the PCB fabricator on inner and outer signal layers to assist" (at 213.890677 77.24173) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp eb087dba-95c2-40e6-a8bd-3f2749bd9f8a)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "the plating process ONLY IF:" (at 165.122669 82.200057) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp f1f75175-8b86-45a1-93c8-7c5d38571b5c)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "Top side with white, permanent, non-conductive ink." (at 181.632673 52.450095) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp f3249f9e-1b67-4a3f-a7f2-afbe1ddf5a36)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "21. ALL .15MM VIAS TO BE VIA-IN-PAD PROCESS (TYPE VII VIAS, PLATED OVER WITH COPPER)" (at 209.445671 176.408295) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp f98ed227-da13-45d2-9058-a3afc16d461b)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )

